flowchart LR
  U[Customer apps] -->|browse, hold, checkout| B[Booking Service\nSaga orchestrator]
  O[Operator systems] <-->|webhook <= 30 s| N[Notification Service]

  subgraph Services[GoHub service boundary]
    B -->|REST: hold/confirm/release| S[Seat Inventory Service]
    B -->|async payment command| K[(Kafka)]
    K --> P[Payment Service]
    P -->|payment.authorized / failed| K
    K --> B
    K --> N
    K --> A[Audit Service]
    S -->|seat.held / confirmed / released / expired| K
  end

  B --- BDB[(Booking PostgreSQL\nSaga state + outbox)]
  S --- SDB[(Seat PostgreSQL\nauthoritative seat state)]
  S --- R[(Redis\n8-minute TTL mirror\n10-minute replay cache)]
  P --- PDB[(Payment PostgreSQL\nattempts + provider refs)]
  N --- NDB[(Notification PostgreSQL\ndelivery attempts)]
  A --- ADB[(Append-only Audit Store)]

  K -. retry topics / DLQ .-> B
  K -. retry topics / DLQ .-> N

  classDef service fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#174a7e,color:#000;
  classDef store fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#555,color:#000;
  class B,S,P,N,A service;
  class BDB,SDB,R,PDB,NDB,ADB,K store;
